# Machine interrupt priority prefers external over software and timer.
# Host setup preloads:
# - controller source 1 enabled and pending
# - MSIP pending
# - machine timer mapped at 0x3000_0000 with mtimecmp = 1
# - mstatus.MIE enabled
# - mie enables machine external, software, and timer interrupts
# - mtvec = 0x20
# Handler clears controller source 1, clears MSIP, pushes mtimecmp out to 256,
# records x10 = 11, and returns with mret.
# Expect x10 = 11, mcause = interrupt 11, mepc = 0, pc = 0.
